# Project Stat Phase

A per-phase statistical estimate on a project. stat_phase is Phase; bucket is Stats Bucket.

◇

attributes:
    - key: estimate_minute
      name: Estimate Minute
      details: Defaults to 0.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 minute"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: estimate_comment
      name: Estimate Comment
      details: Defaults to empty.
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING

associations:
    - name: For Phase
      details: Phase these statistics are for.
      from_multiplicity: any
      to_class_key: definition/phase
      to_multiplicity: "1"
    - name: In Bucket
      details: Stats bucket these statistics are grouped in.
      from_multiplicity: any
      to_class_key: definition/stats_bucket
      to_multiplicity: "1"
    - name: Uses Method
      details: Programming method for these statistics, when one is set.
      from_multiplicity: any
      to_class_key: definition/method
      to_multiplicity: "0..1"
